WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0125: WoW's scene light to BG3's own lighting (on top of 0001-0124).

- link/wowsky.txt: "WSK1 <to-sun x y z, WoW axes> <diffuse r g b> <ambient r g b>" (Light.dbc as sampled for the time
  of day, sRGB 0..1), written whole when a value moved by 0.002 or more. The mod (WorldLight.lua) sets the sun, its
  colour and the sky light of its own lighting at the fight spot from it.

